                                                "sense_id": "cbc90bb7-d6ea-30e1-9c24-ca9de4e13098",
                                                "text": "Dawn found him still awake, in one of the two taverns of Cumbe, drinking brandy with sour cherries and having a ballad contest with the caboclo Matias de Tavares."
